# scripts/secret-scan.allow — reviewable suppressions for `pnpm secret:scan`.
#
# Format (one entry per line):
#   <repo-relative-path>:<rule-id>  <reason, at least a short sentence>
#
# Rules:
#   - Two or more spaces separate the entry from the reason; the reason is
#     mandatory and the scanner exits 2 without it.
#   - Never add an entry for a real credential. If a real secret is found,
#     rotate it and remove it from the tree instead.
#   - Never delete or loosen a pattern in scripts/secret-scan.mjs to make
#     this gate pass (AGENTS.md "Quality gates").
#   - Keep entries as narrow as possible: one path + one rule id each.
#
# No entries yet: the tree is clean under the current pattern set.
